<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF seeks 105,000 tonnes corn or wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF seeks 105,000 tonnes corn or wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) has invited tenders for a total of 105,000 tonnes of corn or feed wheat, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Traders said arrival was set for tow ports out of Inchon, Ulsan, Kunsan and Pusan.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p> POSITION  TONNE   ETA	    SHIPMENT</p>
<p>   One     52,500  March 25   Feb 3-22 (U.S.Gulf/Europe)</p>
<p>					Feb 22-Mar 13 (PNW/AUST/CAN)</p>
<p>					Mar 1-20 (China)</p>
<p>   Two     52,500  April 10   Feb 19-Mar 10 (U.S.Gulf/Europe)</p>
<p>					Mar 10-29 (PNW/AUST/CAN)</p>
<p>					Mar 17-Apr 5 (China)</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
